Final Answer:
Let x_{ij} = number of units of product j (ProductName j) to be placed on shelf i (ShelfID i), for i = 1,...,10 and j = 1,...,20. All x_{ij} are nonnegative integers.

Parameters:
- ShelfID and Capacity (from capacity.csv):

| ShelfID | Capacity |
|---------|----------|
| 1       | 500      |
| 2       | 700      |
| 3       | 600      |
| 4       | 800      |
| 5       | 550      |
| 6       | 900      |
