- ProductName, Value, and Weight (from products.csv):

| ProductName | Value | Weight |
|-------------|-------|--------|
| 1           | 50    | 10     |
| 2           | 70    | 20     |
| 3           | 30    | 5      |
| 4           | 60    | 15     |
| 5           | 80    | 25     |
| 6           | 90    | 30     |
| 7           | 40    | 12     |
| 8           | 100   | 35     |
| 9           | 55    | 10     |
| 10          | 75    | 20     |
| 11          | 65    | 18     |
